---
layout: layout.liquid
title: "About I-70 Bass Anglers"
description: "Learn about the I-70 Bass Anglers club history, organization, and membership."
bodyClass: page-about
hideHeader: true
---

<section class="ct-hero">
  <div class="ct-hero-band">
    {% include "hero-nav.liquid" %}
    <div class="ct-hero-inner">
      <p class="ct-hero-eyebrow">Northeast Kansas &middot; I-70 Corridor</p>
      <h1 class="ct-hero-title">About the Club</h1>
      <p class="ct-hero-sub">Founded as FROGGZ &mdash; still fishing strong.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="container">

  <section class="about-meeting">
    <div class="about-meeting-tag">
      <p class="about-meeting-label">Meeting Info</p>
    </div>
    <div class="about-meeting-when">
      <p class="about-meeting-day">First Thursday</p>
      <p class="about-meeting-time">7:00 PM</p>
      <p class="about-meeting-place">Conference Center at Acorns Resort</p>
      <p class="about-meeting-address">3710 Farnum Creek Road &middot; Milford, Kansas</p>
    </div>
    <div class="about-meeting-details">
      <p><strong>What we cover:</strong> Tournament results &amp; standings, upcoming tournament details, and general club business.</p>
      <p><strong>Who&rsquo;s invited:</strong> All active members and anyone interested in joining are welcome to attend.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="ct-bridge"><span class="ct-bridge-label">Who We Are</span></div>

  <section class="ct-about">
    <div class="ct-about-body">
      <p>We&rsquo;re a small but passionate group dedicated to competitive bass fishing and making sure the sport thrives for generations to come. Whether you&rsquo;re a seasoned tournament angler or just getting started, you&rsquo;re welcome on the water with us.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="ct-about-meta">
      <div class="ct-about-block">
        <p class="ct-awards-label">Follow Us</p>
        <ul class="ct-awards-list">
          <li><a href="https://facebook.com/I70.Bass.Anglers">Facebook</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="ct-about-block">
        <p class="ct-awards-label">Season</p>
        <ul class="ct-awards-list">
          <li>March through October</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="ct-info-grid ct-info-grid--3col">
    <div class="ct-info-item">
      <span class="ct-info-label">Live Weigh-Ins</span>
      <span class="ct-info-value">Fish are weighed live in front of the crowd, then released. No paper tournaments. No apps.</span>
    </div>
    <div class="ct-info-item">
      <span class="ct-info-label">Team Format</span>
      <span class="ct-info-value">Boaters and Co-Anglers compete together. The best 5 fish per boat count, regardless of who caught them.</span>
    </div>
    <div class="ct-info-item">
      <span class="ct-info-label">Club Classic</span>
      <span class="ct-info-value">Season&rsquo;s top finishers earn a spot in an end-of-year invitational &mdash; no entry fee.</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="ct-bridge"><span class="ct-bridge-label">Joining the Club</span></div>

  <ol class="join-steps">
    <li class="join-step">
      <span class="join-step-num">1</span>
      <div class="join-step-body">
        <span class="join-step-title">Attend a Meeting</span>
        <span class="join-step-desc">Come out any first Thursday of the month &mdash; 7:00 PM at Acorns Resort.</span>
      </div>
    </li>
    <li class="join-step">
      <span class="join-step-num">2</span>
      <div class="join-step-body">
        <span class="join-step-title">Fish a Tournament</span>
        <span class="join-step-desc">Compete in a club tournament as a guest to get a feel for how we fish.</span>
      </div>
    </li>
    <li class="join-step">
      <span class="join-step-num">3</span>
      <div class="join-step-body">
        <span class="join-step-title">Member Vote</span>
        <span class="join-step-desc">Receive a majority vote from active members at the next meeting.</span>
      </div>
    </li>
    <li class="join-step">
      <span class="join-step-num">4</span>
      <div class="join-step-body">
        <span class="join-step-title">Pay Dues &amp; Fish</span>
        <span class="join-step-desc">Pay annual dues and start competing in the points race.</span>
      </div>
    </li>
  </ol>

  <div class="ct-bridge"><span class="ct-bridge-label">Leadership</span></div>

  <section class="officers-grid">

    <div class="officer-card">
      <span class="officer-role">President</span>
      <span class="officer-name">{{ club_officers.president.name }}</span>
      <span class="officer-since">Since {{ club_officers.president.year }}</span>
      <span class="officer-duties">Overall club leadership, meeting coordination, external relations</span>
    </div>

    <div class="officer-card">
      <span class="officer-role">Vice President</span>
      <span class="officer-name">{{ club_officers.vice_president.name }}</span>
      <span class="officer-since">Since {{ club_officers.vice_president.year }}</span>
      <span class="officer-duties">Member relations, event planning, president support</span>
    </div>

    <div class="officer-card">
      <span class="officer-role">Secretary</span>
      <span class="officer-name">{{ club_officers.secretary.name }}</span>
      <span class="officer-since">Since {{ club_officers.secretary.year }}</span>
      <span class="officer-duties">Meeting minutes, membership records, website</span>
    </div>

    <div class="officer-card">
      <span class="officer-role">Treasurer</span>
      <span class="officer-name">{{ club_officers.treasurer.name }}</span>
      <span class="officer-since">Since {{ club_officers.treasurer.year }}</span>
      <span class="officer-duties">Financial management, dues collection, budget oversight</span>
    </div>

    <div class="officer-card">
      <span class="officer-role">Tournament Director</span>
      <span class="officer-name">{{ club_officers.tournament_director.name }}</span>
      <span class="officer-since">Since {{ club_officers.tournament_director.year }}</span>
      <span class="officer-duties">Tournament scheduling, rules enforcement, scoring</span>
    </div>

    <div class="officer-card">
      <span class="officer-role">Asst. Tournament Director</span>
      <span class="officer-name">{{ club_officers.asst_tournament_director.name }}</span>
      <span class="officer-since">Since {{ club_officers.asst_tournament_director.year }}</span>
      <span class="officer-duties">Tournament support, weigh-in coordination</span>
    </div>

    <div class="officer-card">
      <span class="officer-role">MLTS Tournament Director</span>
      <span class="officer-name">{{ club_officers.mlts_tournament_director.name }}</span>
      <span class="officer-since">Since {{ club_officers.mlts_tournament_director.year }}</span>
      <span class="officer-duties">MLTS scheduling, rules enforcement, scoring</span>
    </div>

  </section>

  <section class="ct-contact-strip">
    <div class="ct-contact-inner">
      <span class="ct-contact-role">Questions?</span>
      <a href="mailto:{{ contact.club.email }}" class="ct-contact-link">{{ contact.club.email }}</a>
      <span class="ct-contact-sep">&middot;</span>
      <a href="tel:{{ contact.club.phone }}" class="ct-contact-link">{{ contact.club.phone }}</a>
    </div>
  </section>

</div>

<section class="home-footer">
  <div class="home-footer-inner">
    <div class="home-footer-brand">
      <p class="home-footer-name">I-70 Bass Anglers</p>
      <p class="home-footer-tagline">Northeast Kansas &middot; I-70 Corridor</p>
    </div>
    <div class="home-footer-contact">
      <a href="mailto:{{ contact.club.email }}">{{ contact.club.email }}</a>
      <span class="home-footer-sep">&middot;</span>
      <a href="https://facebook.com/I70.Bass.Anglers">Facebook</a>
    </div>
    <p class="home-footer-copy">&copy; {{ site.year }} I-70 Bass Anglers. All rights reserved.</p>
  </div>
</section>
